==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|testimonial}}, from {{der|en|LL.|testimonialis||of or pertaining to testimony}}, from {{der|en|la|testimonium||testimony}}. See {{m|en|testimony}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[statement]], especially one given under [[oath]]; [[testimony]]
# A written [[recommendation]] of someone's [[worth]] or [[character]]
# A [[tribute]] given in [[appreciation]] of someone's [[service]] etc.
# {{lb|en|football}} A [[match]] played in tribute to a particular player (who sometimes receives a proportion of the gate money).

